{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act25side_level_act25side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act25side",
  "stageId": "act25side_09",
  "title": "恩怨糾葛",
  "storyCode": "CW-9",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "37a9398ae5490662734b9065841ba8b60f2d2f0f97bd8353f1a0c72fc8c379e4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "曾經，對於這片大地，抬頭仰望沒有意義。\n那裡不值得被觀察，那裡不值得被探索，那裡是湎於幻想之人的歸宿。\n可是，現在，每個人都在抬頭仰望，抬頭仰望那道連接天與地的光束。\n仰望著從來便觸不可及的天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g18_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星辰中，在光流中顯得如此渺小的人造物，正醞釀著屬於這個時代的，人類的野心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g3_rhinelab_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰，克麗斯騰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你果然早就做好了計劃，國防部之前所有的行動都只是在做無用功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈！這到底是什麼原理？這種高能約束場的效率與穩定性......我從沒聽說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得你在剛加入萊茵的時候，向我吹噓過，你是高能物理領域最好的科學家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，你該慶幸，你所涉獵的學術領域裡沒有一位克麗斯騰這樣的人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很不公平。而她......甚至不屑於發表這些成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聚焦發生器正在蓄能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照軍方的“地平弧光計劃”，等充能階段結束，這些能量將會聚焦並二度激發，在大範圍內進行強力打擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。還要充多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰把計劃書變成了廢紙......我只能說，不會太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我們停下它的最後機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是停下她的最後機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斐爾迪南，你還在發什麼愣，我們的時間不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，看看那邊的密度儀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指針好像很不穩定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是指針，搖擺是高能約束場的正常現象。我說的是......讀數單位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以猜猜，這個單位，是我實驗室裡儀錶的多少倍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它剛才吸收的能量，足足能夠維持整個哥倫比亞所有移動城市至少半年的消耗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它甚至依然沒有停下的跡象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我們，現在就在承載了如此龐大能量的實驗室中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使娜斯提天縱之才，她也製造不出能儲存超出現有認知水準的能量的容器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的意思是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論它最終將能量聚焦向什麼方向，只要二度激發開始，這座實驗室就一定無法倖免於難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的目標從未變過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果她的目標真的是天空，如果天空必須要用這個等級的能量才能挑戰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天上究竟有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不關心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只知道，這是一場冒進而無謀的實驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且註定墜落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，你現在完全可以打道回府，找個視野開闊的山坡，一邊喝酒，一邊欣賞一朵或許將永載哥倫比亞史冊的煙火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那種情況不會發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢？你不會這麼冒險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來是我的老朋友來了，他們的速度比我想的要快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對，我可不打算冒險，技術手冊上記錄了逃生艙段的位置，我知道在哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒興趣去見開除我的那個人，你也用不上我幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記錄眼下這種高能物理現象的機會很少，我不會錯過這樣的機會。也許下個季度你能在學報上看到我的新論文。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我保證，那一定會是劃時代的一篇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰把她所有的智慧都綁在了個人的偏執上，我和她不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會同意......她把這些足以改變整個泰拉學界的知識就此葬送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忙你的去吧，塞雷婭，我們的時間都不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斐爾迪南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久不見，上校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能活下來，我不意外，但如果我是你，我會假裝自己已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開這裡，跑去維多利亞或者萊塔尼亞，憑你的本事，謀一份教職總是可以的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不像是你會說出的話，上校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再說一遍，斐爾迪南，已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和副總統已經談過了，國防部輸得很徹底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於這件事還能不能被挽回，我的命最終會交到誰的手上，我其實已經沒那麼關心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我們留些體面吧，斐爾迪南，滾開，我可以省下一支弩箭留給自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在說什麼？抱歉，我剛剛沒注意聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，你擋住射線儀的螢幕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座能量井，比我想像的要深得多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕軍方根本沒有完全掌握它的結構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡......是傳導物質反應最強的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_prison_commandroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默，你怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕爾維斯......老師......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默......這間實驗室的位置應該是保密的，你怎麼找到這裡來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "赫默努力睜大眼睛，辨別著房間裡的東西。\n房間的角落裡，儀器正發出呼吸一般的嗡鳴，一個透明的罐體中，傳導物質正在其中浮沉。另一邊，放著幾本封皮漆黑的書籍。\n似乎感受到赫默的存在，傳導物質稍稍活躍了些。強烈的暈眩感讓赫默皺緊了眉頭，搖晃了幾下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，對了，你也有傳導物質......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，這些活性傾向......你給自己注射了傳導物質？倒也不意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是偶爾會有不適感？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是正常反應，我身體裡也有這些東西，對於你們年輕人應該還好，我這樣上了年紀的人，確實會感覺有點吃不消。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，只有這樣才能更好地控制反應進程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，等到實驗結束，這批傳導物質的跨距離糾纏性質會喪失，不會影響到注射者未來的健康狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實驗？您在這裡做實驗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默，你的手受傷了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "影響活動嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我也就不多問了，現在是最關鍵的時刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能找到這裡，也許真的能幫上我的忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才我還在念叨，如果你在的話，資料處理方面我能輕鬆不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我最近......不，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您到底在做什麼實驗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真正投入精力的研究方向始終只有一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嵌合實驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，這是嵌合實驗的最後一個課題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師，這些文獻是什麼？這上面的文字給人的感覺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很“邪惡”，對吧？這是薩卡茲的古籍，記錄了某個分支種族的“歷史”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個分支的薩卡茲不僅擁有長久的生命，還能跨越肉體的束縛，以一種純精神態在世間存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們被稱為“死魂靈”。這個發音非常晦澀，但姑且能找到一些維多利亞語的記錄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默，你有沒有想過，靈魂層面上的嵌合會產生什麼影響？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "靈魂的嵌合？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種“死魂靈”......古老源石技藝和薩卡茲巫術裡所謂的“靈魂”，有可能透過後天手段產生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您在試圖創造一種人造意識？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一直是我最好的學生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這項工作我已經進行了數十年，進展一直很有限，直到斐爾迪南告訴我，他和多蘿西共同製造了這種特別的“傳導物質”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒法想像當時我有多興奮，赫默！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我完全可以肯定，“傳導物質”的性質......足夠成為人造意識誕生的土壤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，在這片大地上，無論多精密的實驗室，擾動卻始終存在。這些擾動困擾了我很久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有很多種可能，也許是激發傳導物質的能量不夠大，也許是實驗室的密閉等級還不夠，源石干擾了意識的產生與聚合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，不再重要了。赫默，今天一切的困惑都會獲得解答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這會是我最後的研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最為理想的實驗環境即將形成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕爾維斯老師......您負責用傳導物質解決“弧光一號”的操縱精度問題，您這裡......是傳導物質新的中樞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰想做些自以為冒險的事，她認為她的工作很有意義......我不願評判同行的成果，但說實話，我們這些研究者懦弱得太久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平庸、無聊、保守、瞻前顧後......赫默，我們這些擁有知識、擁有能力的人，所要做的從來不只是“探索”或“進步”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們背負科學，我們被它命令，供它驅策，它要求我們承擔起強大的靈魂才能承擔的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——開創一個新的時代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“開創一個新的時代”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默......你有資格與我一起見證這真正偉大成果的誕生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很快了，很快了......平庸的歲月將要結束，科學的神祇必須歸位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您在顫抖，老師。我很少見您這副樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？也許是傳導物質的反應太強烈了，也許是我真的上了年紀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默，我相信你能感同身受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來，您真的很期待這一刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，老師，我必須向您坦白，我會摧毀傳導物質的中樞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼，赫默？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，我會停下這裡正在發生的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論是總轄的計劃，還是您的野心，都必須要被重新審視。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這正是我來到這裡的目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個孩子動搖了你對於科學的忠誠，但我始終相信，你有一個研究者的品質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我從沒有真正地責怪你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這次，不管你是不是在開一個荒唐的玩笑，我都不能容忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要你向我道歉，赫默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會收回我說的任何一句話，老師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論是當年，還是現在，我都不認為我做錯了什麼。你們真正想要的，是肆意妄為的權力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可笑。赫默，你大錯特錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，你可以說，我要的是肆意妄為的權力，那是因為我知道，哪些研究是重要的，哪些研究能開創未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想和我說那套科學屬於大眾的陳腔濫調？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必須告訴你，赫默，科學屬於超人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "庸眾可以去選擇政客，庸眾可以去崇拜領袖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但唯有科學，他們不配染指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那您呢，老師？您是自己希望的那種，“超人”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我已經沒有機會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果我創造出的這種意識足夠理性，足夠宏偉，它就能夠——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它不能，老師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您連人都不相信，您憑什麼認為一個初生的意識，就能超越這片大地上的一切呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不明白，赫默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您把全部的心血投入在嵌合實驗這個項目上，一次次期待以生物工程的方式創造強大的造物，是不是正因為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您無法回避自己的羸弱呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赫默，你不能這麼揣測我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我......擺脫平庸的，最後的希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g3_rhinelab_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我沒有想到，在這裡能看到你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "防衛科曾經的同僚們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，塞雷婭主任，“曾經的同僚”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們現在是總轄構件科雇員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“總轄構件科”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不能通過這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們做得比上次要好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們知道克麗斯騰想做什麼，這只會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道，我也並不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我在萊茵的員工編號，塞雷婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "011，那時候雅拉還沒來，是我和克麗斯騰一起面試的你，詹姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時，我也收到了其他公司的邀請，沃爾沃特科欽斯基還有沙灘傘，但我沒有一秒考慮過它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我始終相信著你們，塞雷婭，還有克麗斯騰。因為我相信你們與他們不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這只是你的自我感動，詹姆，這裡很快就會墜毀，我建議你們馬上乘坐逃生艙段離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會等到墜毀那一刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，在此之前，想看見些特別的景色嗎，塞雷婭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜斯提對我們形容過這一幕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塞雷婭察覺到，整個走廊正在偏移。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g4_rhinelab_corridor_rised"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "總轄構件科雇員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_902_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我從沒在這個高度俯瞰過大地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——聚焦發生器已經開始姿態調整。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒時間了，讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g4_rhinelab_corridor_rised"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死，怎麼回事？這東西在轉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜，這是技術手冊上說的“姿態調整”，是二次激發的前置步驟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官，需要我扶您一把嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......走廊裡的這些門怎麼關上了？斐爾迪南呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他趁剛剛的機會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我追上他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了走廊的隔斷門，這裡就沒有別的自衛系統了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是我的話，一定在這裡塞滿動力甲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不許動，斐爾迪南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "逮到你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是不想讓你們繼續打擾我，上校，在這裡的每一分鐘都很寶貴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而與你們打交道會浪費掉我所有的精力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原本以為我們是同類，斐爾迪南，我們是清醒的理性主義者，會權衡利弊後再做決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我看錯你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我們走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "射線激發的讀數是1.22，這裡應該需要引入一個常數，來重整化整個公式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，我在嘲笑你，布萊克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在嘲笑你，多可悲，權力、勳章、你在國防部的地位......你的眼睛永遠無法從那些東西上移開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我們正站在幾乎沒有人觸及過的高度，被科學的奇蹟環繞，幾乎隨手就能從儀器中摘出一條新的公式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以看到，在這裡，你所執著的那些榮譽是多麼渺小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你的萊茵生命呢，斐爾迪南？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不是你緊緊盯著的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要糾正你一點，我盯著的是萊茵生命所代表的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊茵生命是我的手段，我的階梯，我的臂膀。但不是目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕您忘了，我可以自豪地宣稱，我是這片大地......不，現在是大地與天空，最優秀的高能物理學家之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我盯著的，從來只有科學本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰，克麗斯騰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她創造了這些，她浪費了這些，她是個奢侈的天才。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我如此地嫉妒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我也不得不承認，我如此地享受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，現在我的每一分每一秒都如此重要，沒有一點點時間可以浪費在你身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以命令你，斐爾迪南，別忘了你該聽命於誰，別忘了是誰給了你一次新的機會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校，你知道怎麼阻止一個好奇的科學家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滿足他，或者，殺死他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解決掉，別浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一件事，我需要提醒你們，士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座聚焦發生器會在二次激發後墜毀，連帶著我們所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許這些資料對你們沒意義，但是你們的命......我相信，很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你們想知道逃生艙段在哪就不要那麼急著動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你，布萊克，留好你的弩箭吧......射向你自己，或者你的頂頭上司什麼的，我無所謂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，不要打壞我的儀器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
